---
import CodeBlock from './CodeBlock.astro'
import { SNIPPETS } from '../snippets/index.ts'
---

<section class="section" id="setup">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Set up in three steps</h2>
      <p>You need Node 24+ and a bot token from @BotFather.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="card">
        <span class="step-number">1</span>
        <h3>Install</h3>
        <p>Paste the BotFather token when it asks. It installs the service and prints a pairing code.</p>
        <CodeBlock code={SNIPPETS.npxInit} prompt />
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <span class="step-number">2</span>
        <h3>Pair</h3>
        <p>Send the code to your bot. Only whoever proves they own it gets answers.</p>
        <CodeBlock code={SNIPPETS.pair} />
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <span class="step-number">3</span>
        <h3>Connect your agent</h3>
        <p>For Claude Code, add the MCP server.</p>
        <CodeBlock code={SNIPPETS.mcpAdd} prompt />
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
